<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>For Sowmya ❤️</title>

<style>
body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
    background: linear-gradient(to right, #ff758c, #ff7eb3);
    text-align: center;
    color: white;
}

header {
    padding: 60px 20px;
}

header h1 {
    font-size: 45px;
}

section {
    background: white;
    color: #333;
    margin: 20px;
    padding: 20px;
    border-radius: 15px;
}

.gallery img {
    width: 200px;
    border-radius: 15px;
    margin: 10px;
    transition: transform 0.3s;
}

.gallery img:hover {
    transform: scale(1.1);
}

button {
    padding: 15px 25px;
    font-size: 18px;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: #ff4d6d;
    color: white;
    cursor: pointer;
}

.hidden {
    display: none;
    margin-top: 20px;
    font-size: 22px;
    color: #ff4d6d;
}

footer {
    padding: 20px;
}
</style>

</head>

<body>

<header>
    <h1>Hi Sowmya ❤️</h1>
    <p>This is something special just for you...</p>
</header>

<section>
    <h2>Our Story 💕</h2>
    <p>
        Every moment with you feels magical.  
        From the first time we met, my life became more beautiful.  
        You are my happiness, my peace, and my forever ❤️
    </p>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Why I Love You ❤️</h2>
    <p>
        Your smile 😊<br>
        Your kindness 💖<br>
        Your love 💕<br><br>
        Everything about you makes my world perfect ❤️
    </p>
</section>

<section class="gallery">
    <h2>Our Beautiful Memories 📸</h2>
    <img src="img1.jpg">
    <img src="img2.jpg">
    <img src="img3.jpg">
    <img src="img4.jpg">
    <img src="img5.jpg">
</section>

<section>
    <h2>A Surprise For You 🎁</h2>
    <button onclick="showLove()">Click Here ❤️</button>
    <div id="msg" class="hidden">
        Sowmya 💖  
        You are the best thing that ever happened to me.  
        I promise to love you forever ❤️
    </div>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Our Song 🎶</h2>
    <audio controls autoplay loop>
        <source src="song.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
    </audio>
</section>

<footer>
    <p>Made with ❤️ only for you Sowmya</p>
</footer>

<script>
function showLove() {
    document.getElementById("msg").style.display = "block";
}
</script>

</body>
</html>
